From 04bd05b5c121fbee49ba02b70159b4005cbc9ffb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dekum69 <87270170+Dekum69@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:28:59 +0545
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] feat(Instagram): auto-delete view history after a chosen
 duration

Adds an "Auto-delete history" picker to the History settings section:
Keep forever (default), 1 day, 2 days, 3 days, 1 week, 2 weeks, 1 month
or 3 months.

- Settings.SAVE_VIEW_HISTORY_RETENTION: StringSetting holding the number of
  days, 0 meaning keep forever.
- ListPref: supplies the new string-array pair for the picker, matching how
  the other list preferences are wired.
- PikoHistoryDb.pruneOlderThan(days): deletes rows whose viewed_at is older
  than the cutoff; 0 is a no-op.
- Pruning runs whenever a new view is logged (DB thread) and when the history
  screen opens, so lowering the limit takes effect immediately.
- Strings for the picker and all eight entries, plus docs.
